 like 24-35 year olds usually have one or two cups of coffee (or, this means that there were more 24-35 year olds sampled than other age groups. Whoops.).</span>\n\n## <span style=\"color:#6F4E37;\"> Which of the blind-tasted coffees are percieved as the most acidic? </span>\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](coffee_quarto_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n<span style=\"color:#8B5A2B;\">Looks like coffee A and D were the most acidic, as voted by the taste-testers.</span>\n\n\n## <span style=\"color:#6F4E37;\"> Comparing acidity and bitterness, and showing popularity </span>\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"plotly html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-be0ca00f9c24f5e18061\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-be0ca00f9c24f5e18061\">{\"x\":{\"data\":[{\"x\":[3.6336161187698832],\"y\":[2.1406332453825856],\"text\":\"mean_acidity: 3.633616<br />mean_bitterness: 2.140633<br />n_prefer:  814<br />coffee: Coffee A\",\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"markers\",\"marker\":{\"autocolorscale\":false,\"color\":\"rgba(111,78,55,1)\",\"opacity\":0.80000000000000004,\"size\":24.360632835846303,\"symbol\":\"circle\",\"line\":{\"width\":1.8897637795275593,\"color\":\"rgba(111,78,55,1)\"}},\"hoveron\":\"points\",\"name\":\"Coffee A\",\"legendgroup\":\"Coffee A\",\"showlegend\":true,\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"yaxis\":\"y\",\"hoverinfo\":\"text\",\"frame\":null},{\"x\":[2.2227248536455559],\"y\":[3.0140583554376659],\"text\":\"mean_acidity: 2.222725<br />mean_bitterness: 3.014058<br />n_prefer:  778<br />coffee: Coffee B\",\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"markers\",\"marker\":{\"autocolorscale\":false,\"color\":\"rgba(139,90,43,1)\",\"opacity\":0.80000000000000004,\"size\":15.118110236220474,\"symbol\":\"circle\",\"line\":{\"width\":1.8897637795275593,\"color\":\"rgba(139,90,43,1)\"}},\"hoveron\":\"points\",\"name\":\"Coffee B\",\"legendgro